<h1>presentations</h1>

<dl>
  <li> do fit within time window, sharp, you will be cut off
  <li> focus on YOUR study and YOUR contribution; not background info
    or what others did
  <li> not too many slides, like 1 per minute, 15 min presentation like 15 slides
  <li> not too many lines per slide, like <=12 
  <li> do take notes (right away, during the presentation)!!! 
    the whole purpose of presenting is to get 
    comments! (to enlighten the audience is typically
    secondary); if you do not take notes, you will
    forget the comments			    
</dl>				    

